    text: 'Archive custody, Daylight Protocol / Unbound: The Night Index is published with its signatures intact. People begin auditing the systems that decide their lives. The release reaches every district at once. It breaks the old consensus and leaves difficult repairs for the survivors. A second copy carries a hand-written objection to the official disposition.'
